# Naming Conventions

- **Files:** `kebab-case.ext` (`.ts`, `.html`, `.scss`)
- **Services:** `kebab-case-service.ts`
- **Modules:** `kebab-case.module.ts`
- **Directives:** `kebab-case.directive.ts`
- **Pipes:** `kebab-case.pipe.ts`
- **Guards:** `kebab-case.guard.ts`
- **Connectors:** `kebab-case.connector.ts`
- **Models / Enums / Constants:**
  - `kebab-case.interface.ts`
  - `kebab-case.enum.ts`
  - `kebab-case.ts` for constants
